' ============================================================================
' Nexus AI Lab — M1 架构图集 (PlantUML)
'
' 一个文件包含 5 张图,按顺序渲染:
'   1. 组件视图  —— 前端/后端/模块之间怎么连
'   2. 类图      —— 后端三个核心类的职责与依赖
'   3. 时序图    —— 一次完整的任务提交 + SSE 推送
'   4. 状态机    —— 任务生命周期 queued → running → completed/failed
'   5. 线程模型  —— 谁在哪个线程上跑,锁在哪里
'
' 渲染方式:
'   plantuml architecture.puml
'   VS Code 装 "PlantUML" 扩展后按 Alt+D 预览
' ============================================================================


' ============================================================================
' 图 1:组件视图
' ============================================================================
@startuml 01-component-view
title Nexus AI Lab M1 — 组件视图

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "浏览器操作员" as Operator

package "frontend (Vite :5173)" {
  [App.tsx\n任务提交 / 状态机 / 时间线] as App
  [api.ts\nHTTP + SSE 客户端] as Api
  [types.ts\n共享数据形状] as Types
}

package "backend (nexus-server :8080)" {
  [HttpServer\n路由 + 连接生命周期] as Http
  [TaskManager\n任务状态 + 生命周期] as Tasks
  [SseHub\n订阅者队列 + 事件广播] as Hub
}

database "内存\n(无持久化)" as Memory

Operator --> App : 输入 prompt
App --> Api : createTask / fetchTask / EventSource
Api ..> Types : 类型约束
App ..> Types

Api --> Http : 开发模式下走 Vite 代理\n/api → localhost:8080
Http --> Tasks : create_task / get_task / get_events
Tasks --> Hub : EventSink 回调 publish()
Tasks --> Memory : tasks_ (unordered_map)
Hub --> Memory : subscribers_ / history_

note right of Http
  HttpServer 不执行任何模型或系统命令。
  它只做三件事:解析请求、校验参数、写响应。
end note

note bottom of Hub
  SSE 只负责"把已经发生的事件送出去",
  不产生事件。事件源头永远是 TaskManager。
end note

@enduml


' ============================================================================
' 图 2:类图
' ============================================================================
@startuml 02-class-diagram
title Nexus AI Lab M1 — 后端类图

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum TaskStatus {
  queued
  running
  completed
  failed
}

class TaskEvent {
  + sequence : uint64
  + task_id : string
  + status : TaskStatus
  + message : string
  + timestamp : string
}

class TaskSnapshot {
  + id : string
  + prompt : string
  + status : TaskStatus
  + created_at : string
  + updated_at : string
  + events : vector<TaskEvent>
}

class TaskManager {
  - mutex_ : mutable mutex
  - tasks_ : unordered_map<string, TaskRecord>
  - workers_ : vector<thread>
  - event_sink_ : EventSink
  --
  + create_task(prompt) : string
  + get_task(id) : optional<TaskSnapshot>
  + get_events(id) : optional<vector<TaskEvent>>
  - run_task(id) : void
  - append_event(id, status, message) : optional<TaskEvent>
}

class SseHub {
  - mutex_ : mutex
  - subscribers_ : unordered_map<string, vector<SubscriberPtr>>
  - history_ : unordered_map<string, vector<TaskEvent>>
  --
  + subscribe(task_id, backlog) : SubscriberPtr
  + wait_for_event(subscriber) : optional<TaskEvent>
  + publish(event) : void
  + unsubscribe(task_id, subscriber) : void
}

class Subscriber {
  + mutex : mutex
  + condition : condition_variable
  + events : deque<TaskEvent>
  + closed : bool
}

class HttpServer {
  - host_ : string
  - port_ : uint16
  - task_manager_ : TaskManager&
  - sse_hub_ : SseHub&
  --
  + run() : void
  - handle_connection(socket) : void
}

class "EventSink\nstd::function<void(const TaskEvent&)>" as EventSink

TaskSnapshot *-- TaskEvent : 持有
TaskManager --> EventSink : 调用
SseHub *-- Subscriber : 管理
TaskManager ..> TaskEvent : 产生
SseHub ..> TaskEvent : 转发
HttpServer --> TaskManager : 引用
HttpServer --> SseHub : 引用
TaskManager ..> TaskStatus
TaskSnapshot ..> TaskStatus
TaskEvent ..> TaskStatus

note right of TaskManager::create_task
  1. 加锁写入 tasks_
  2. append_event(queued)
  3. 通过 event_sink_ 广播
  4. 起一个后台线程跑 run_task
end note

note right of SseHub::subscribe
  关键:加 hub 锁的同时
  把 backlog + history 去重后
  装进订阅者队列。
  这样"快照"和"注册"之间
  发布的事件不会被丢。
end note

@enduml


' ============================================================================
' 图 3:时序图 —— 一次完整链路
' ============================================================================
@startuml 03-sequence
title Nexus AI Lab M1 — 任务提交到 SSE 完成

skinparam maxMessageSize 60

actor "浏览器" as Browser
participant "App.tsx" as App
participant "HttpServer\n(连接线程)" as Http
participant "TaskManager" as TM
participant "SseHub" as Hub
participant "worker 线程\nrun_task()" as Worker

== 阶段 1:健康检查 ==
App -> Http : GET /api/health
Http --> App : 200 {"status":"ok","milestone":"M1"}

== 阶段 2:创建任务 ==
App -> Http : POST /api/tasks {"prompt":"..."}
Http -> Http : json::parse + 校验\n(is_blank / size > 4000)
alt prompt 非法
  Http --> App : 400 {"error":"..."}
else prompt 合法
  Http -> TM : create_task(prompt)
  TM -> TM : 加锁写 tasks_[id]\nstatus = queued
  TM -> TM : append_event(queued)\nsequence = 1
  TM -> Hub : event_sink_(event) → publish()
  Hub -> Hub : 写 history_[id],\n推给现有订阅者(此刻为空)
  TM -> Worker : std::thread(run_task(id))
  Http --> App : 201 task JSON(含 events[1])
end

== 阶段 3:订阅 SSE ==
App -> Http : GET /api/tasks/{id}/events\n(EventSource)
Http -> TM : get_events(id)
TM --> Http : 快照 [queued]
Http -> Http : 手写响应头 +\nTransfer-Encoding: chunked
Http -> App : chunk: "retry: 1000"
Http -> Hub : subscribe(id, backlog=[queued])
Hub -> Hub : 加 hub 锁 + 订阅者锁\nbacklog ∪ history 按 sequence 去重
Http -> App : chunk: event(status, queued)

== 阶段 4:worker 推进生命周期 ==
Worker -> Worker : sleep 250ms
Worker -> TM : append_event(running)
TM -> Hub : publish(running)
Hub -> Http : 唤醒 condition_variable
Http -> App : chunk: event(status, running)
Worker -> Worker : sleep 650ms
Worker -> TM : append_event(completed)
TM -> Hub : publish(completed)
Hub -> Http : 唤醒
Http -> App : chunk: event(done, completed)
Http -> Hub : unsubscribe(id, subscriber)
Http -> App : "0\r\n\r\n" 结束 chunked

== 阶段 5:前端收敛 ==
App -> App : mergeEvents 按 sequence 去重排序
App -> App : isTerminal → source.close()\nterminalRef = true
note over App : 若在完成前断线:\nonerror → GET /tasks/{id} 兜底拉全量

@enduml


' ============================================================================
' 图 4:任务状态机
' ============================================================================
@startuml 04-task-state
title Nexus AI Lab M1 — 任务生命周期状态机

[*] --> queued : POST /api/tasks\ncreate_task() 写入内存
queued --> running : run_task 线程\nsleep 250ms 后 append_event
running --> completed : sleep 650ms 后 append_event
running --> failed : run_task 抛异常\ncatch → append_event(failed)
completed --> [*] : SSE 发送 "0\\r\\n\\r\\n" 后关闭连接
failed --> [*] : SSE 发送 "0\\r\\n\\r\\n" 后关闭连接

note right of queued
  M1 的 queued 没有真实排队:
  每个任务立刻拿到独立线程。
  状态只用于演示可观测性。
end note

note right of completed
  completed 只表示
  "生命周期演示结束",
  不代表完成了 prompt 里的诊断需求。
end note

@enduml


' ============================================================================
' 图 5:线程与并发模型
' ============================================================================
@startuml 05-threading
title Nexus AI Lab M1 — 线程模型与锁

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1

participant "主线程\nmain() → run()" as Main
participant "acceptor\naccept 循环" as Acc
participant "连接线程 A\nhandle_connection" as ConnA
participant "连接线程 B\nSSE 写循环" as ConnB
participant "worker 线程\nrun_task" as Worker

Main -> Main : 构造 SseHub / TaskManager / HttpServer
Main -> Acc : server.run() 阻塞在 accept

Acc -> ConnA : 新连接 → std::thread(...).detach()
Acc -> ConnB : 新连接 → std::thread(...).detach()

ConnA -> ConnA : http::read 单次请求\n(keep_alive = false)\n处理完即退出

ConnB -> ConnB : asio::write 响应头
ConnB -> ConnB : hub.subscribe(...)
ConnB -> ConnB : wait_for_event 阻塞在\ncondition_variable 上

Worker -> Worker : run_task(id)
Worker -> Worker : append_event → 锁 TaskManager::mutex_
Worker -> Worker : event_sink_ → publish → 锁 SseHub::mutex_

Worker -> ConnB : notify_one
ConnB -> ConnB : 取事件 → write chunk
ConnB -> ConnB : 终止态 → 退出循环 → 线程结束

note over Worker, ConnB
  加锁顺序固定为:
  SseHub::mutex_ → Subscriber::mutex
  不存在反向加锁,因此不会死锁。
end note

note over ConnB
  隐患:SSE 线程只在写失败时
  才发现客户端断开。
  如果客户端静默消失,线程会一直
  阻塞在 wait_for_event 上。
end note

@enduml
